# Copy to an ACL-restricted, service-private path outside the repository.
# Populate only after access is limited to Administrators, SYSTEM, and the
# dedicated collector service identity.
#
# Keep the token double-quoted. Both the WinSW wrapper and the boot task start
# Node with Node's own `--env-file`, which parses the file with dotenv-style
# rules where `#` begins an inline comment. An unquoted token containing `#`
# is truncated at the first `#` and the ingest endpoint rejects the request
# with HTTP 401. Paste the RAW token between the existing quotes and do not add
# your own (the token must not itself contain a `"` character).
TELEMETRY_INGEST_TOKEN="{{TELEMETRY_INGEST_TOKEN}}"
